HCFM3 ~g~GUNNERS:~w~ protecting CJ.
HCFM4 ~p~GUNNERS:~w~ overwatch - armed hostiles only.
HCXROPE ~b~PILOT:~w~ no landing spot here - going down by rope.
HCNOPAD ~b~PILOT:~w~ no flat spot - hovering for a rope exit.
