HCCREW ~g~HELICOVER:~w~ crew changed.
HCCFAIL ~r~HELICOVER:~w~ crew change failed, kept the current crew.
HCBLOCK ~y~PILOT:~w~ cannot land here. Choose open ground or FOLLOW CJ.
HCLOSE ~y~PILOT:~w~ land first.
